# Playwright Automation Spec: Idempotent E2E Checkout Flow

## 1. Test Setup & Dynamic Data Seed Fixtures
Khởi tạo test runner với tài khoản khách hàng cô lập thông qua fixture API:
```typescript
test.beforeEach(async ({ request, context }) => {
  const user = await createTestCustomer(request, { balance: 500000 });
  const item = await seedInventoryItem(request, { stock: 10 });
  context.setExtraHTTPHeaders({ Authorization: `Bearer ${user.token}` });
});
```

## 2. Structured Test Cases & Deterministic Assertions
```typescript
test('TC-E2E-01: Hoàn tất đơn hàng với thẻ tín dụng sandbox', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/checkout');
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Thanh toán' }).click();
  await expect(page.getByTestId('order-success-badge')).toBeVisible({ timeout: 5000 });
  await expect(page.getByTestId('order-status')).toHaveText('ĐÃ THANH TOÁN');
});
```

## 3. Teardown & Idempotent Cleanup
```typescript
test.afterEach(async ({ request }) => {
  if (testOrderId) {
    await request.post(`/api/test/cleanup/orders/${testOrderId}`);
  }
});
```
